    <string name="studio_help_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="studio_help_text">Rhythm: tap the squares to place drum hits; tap again to change their strength. Pick a Style to start from a base, Random for ideas.\n\nNotes: draw notes on the grid, or play the keyboard and press Record while the music runs. The scale keeps every note in tune.\n\nMixer: one strip per track. M mutes, S keeps only that track, Effects adds distortion, lo-fi and a filter. The pad filters or adds reverb while your finger is on it; Record my gesture keeps the move in the loop.\n\nTracks: add, hide or remove tracks (drum sounds, synths, soundfont instruments).

Patterns A to D hold four different loops. Song plays them one after another. Export saves an audio file, a MIDI file, or sends the sound to the audio editor.\n\nMy sound: record two seconds with the microphone; it replaces the sound of the Perc. track.</string>
